      <a href="faq.html" class="nav-link">Preguntas frecuentes</a>
    </div>
    
    <div class="nav-actions">
      <div class="lang-dropdown">
        <button class="lang-dropdown-btn" aria-label="Seleccionar idioma">
          <span class="lang-current">ES</span>
          <svg width="12" height="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 5l4 4 4-4"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="lang-dropdown-menu">
          <a href="../share-story.html" class="lang-option">English</a>
          <a href="../he/share-story.html" class="lang-option">עברית</a>
          <a href="../fr/share-story.html" class="lang-option">Français</a>
          <a href="../ru/share-story.html" class="lang-option">Русский</a>
          <span class="lang-option active">Español</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="../partner-login.html" class="nav-btn nav-btn-ghost">Acceso socios</a>
      <a href="contact.html" class="nav-btn nav-btn-primary">Protégete</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-pattern"></div>
  <div class="container" style="position: relative; z-index: 2;">
    <div class="hero-icon">💜</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">הסיפור שלך <span class="hero-title-accent">חשוב.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">Chaque histoire partagée est un bouclier pour quelqu'un d'autre. Your experience — no matter how painful — can help protect others from the same manipulation. You are not alone, and there is nothing to be ashamed of.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Why Share -->
<section class="section section-warm">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header center">
      <span class="section-label">Pourquoi partager</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Your voice has power.</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Sharing your experience isn't just cathartic — it's an act of courage that creates real change in the world.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="why-share-grid">
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-card-icon">🛡️</div>
        <h3>Protéger les autres</h3>
        <p>When you describe the tactics used against you, you arm others with knowledge. Your story becomes a warning sign that helps someone else recognize danger before it's too late.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-card-icon">💪</div>
        <h3>Reprendre le contrôle</h3>
        <p>Scammers thrive on silence and shame. By speaking up, you take back control of your narrative. Your story becomes one of strength, not victimhood.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-card-icon">🤝</div>
        <h3>Créer une communauté</h3>
        <p>When you share, you show others they're not alone. You create connection and solidarity. Together, we're stronger than any scammer.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-card-icon">📢</div>
        <h3>Sensibiliser</h3>
        <p>Real stories cut through the noise. They make the abstract threat concrete. They move policy makers, journalists, and families to take action.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-card-icon">🔬</div>
        <h3>Améliorer la protection</h3>
        <p>Every story teaches us something new about how scammers operate. Your experience directly informs better detection systems and prevention tools.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-card-icon">❤️</div>
        <h3>Guérir en partageant</h3>
        <p>Many people find that telling their story — and being heard without judgment — is a powerful step in processing what happened and moving forward.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Truth Section -->
<section class="truth-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="truth-content">
      <p class="truth-quote">"Being scammed is <span class="highlight">not a character flaw.</span> Ce n'est pas de la stupidité. It's not carelessness. C'est le résultat d'une manipulation psychologique sophistiquée designed by professionals."</p>
      
      <p class="truth-text">Scammers are trained to exploit fundamental human traits — trust, love, fear, hope, urgency. They study psychology. They practice their craft. They use AI to make their deception flawless.</p>
      
      <p class="truth-text">Doctors fall for scams. Lawyers fall for scams. Cybersecurity experts fall for scams. Judges, professors, engineers — people who analyze risk for a living. Because scams don't target intelligence. They target humanity.</p>
      
      <p class="truth-text" style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--pink);">There is absolutely nothing to be ashamed of.</p>
      
      <div class="truth-stats">
        <div class="truth-stat">
          <div class="truth-stat-value">57%</div>
          <div class="truth-stat-label">of adults targeted yearly</div>
        </div>
        <div class="truth-stat">
          <div class="truth-stat-value">70%</div>
          <div class="truth-stat-label">never tell anyone</div>
        </div>
        <div class="truth-stat">
          <div class="truth-stat-value">$442B</div>
          <div class="truth-stat-label">lost globally each year</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Myths Section -->
<section class="section section-light">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header center">
      <span class="section-label">Breaking the stigma</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Let's destroy these myths.</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">The shame around scams is built on false beliefs. Here's the truth.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="myths-grid">
      <div class="myth-card">
        <span class="myth-label">Myth</span>
        <p class="myth-text">"Only naive or uneducated people fall for scams."</p>
        <span class="truth-label">Truth</span>
        <p class="reality-text">Scammers specifically target successful, educated people because they have more to lose. Intelligence doesn't protect you — awareness does.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="myth-card">
        <span class="myth-label">Myth</span>
        <p class="myth-text">"I should have known better."</p>
        <span class="truth-label">Truth</span>
        <p class="reality-text">Scammers are professional manipulators. They create scenarios designed to bypass rational thinking. Hindsight isn't a fair judge of decisions made under manufactured pressure.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="myth-card">
        <span class="myth-label">Myth</span>
        <p class="myth-text">"If I tell people, they'll think less of me."</p>
        <span class="truth-label">Truth</span>
        <p class="reality-text">Most people respond with empathy, not judgment. And those who judge often do so out of fear — a fear that diminishes when they hear your story.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="myth-card">
        <span class="myth-label">Myth</span>
        <p class="myth-text">"My story isn't important enough to share."</p>
        <span class="truth-label">Truth</span>
        <p class="reality-text">Every scam attempt — whether you lost money or not — contains valuable information. Your story might be the exact warning someone else needs to hear.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Example Stories -->
<section class="section section-gray">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header center">
      <span class="section-label">Voices like yours</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Others have shared. You can too.</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">These are real people who found courage to speak up — and helped others in the process.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="stories-examples">
      <div class="story-example">
        <p class="story-example-quote">"I'm a software engineer. I build security systems for a living. And I almost wired $15,000 to someone pretending to be my son. The voice was perfect — it was AI. Sharing this story felt humiliating at first, but then three of my colleagues told me they'd had similar calls. We weren't stupid. We were targeted."</p>
        <p class="story-example-author">— David, 58</p>
        <p class="story-example-context">His story has been shared over 2,000 times and helped identify a voice cloning ring</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="story-example">
        <p class="story-example-quote">"After my husband passed, I was lonely. A man online seemed to understand. Over six months, I sent him $40,000 for emergencies that never existed. I blamed myself for years. Then I shared my story at a community center. An elderly woman came up to me crying — I had just described exactly what was happening to her. We stopped her from losing her savings. That's when I realized: my shame was protecting scammers, not me."</p>
        <p class="story-example-author">— Margaret, 71</p>
        <p class="story-example-context">Now speaks at senior centers about romance scams</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="story-example">
        <p class="story-example-quote">"The 'job offer' seemed perfect — remote work, great pay. They just needed my bank details for direct deposit. I'm 24 and supposedly 'digital native.' I felt like an idiot. But when I posted about it, my DMs exploded. Dozens of people my age had the same thing happen. This isn't a personal failure. It's an epidemic."</p>
        <p class="story-example-author">— Priya, 24</p>
        <p class="story-example-context">Her post reached 50K people and was cited in a news investigation</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Our Promise -->
<section class="promise-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header center">
      <span class="section-label">Our promise to you</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Share safely with us.</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">We treat every story with the respect and care it deserves.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="promise-grid">
      <div class="promise-card">
        <div class="promise-icon">🔒</div>
        <div>
          <h4>Complete anonymity</h4>
          <p>We never publish names or identifying details without explicit permission.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="promise-card">
        <div class="promise-icon">🤐</div>
        <div>
          <h4>No judgment</h4>
          <p>Our team understands that scams can happen to anyone. We're here to listen, not to judge.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="promise-card">
        <div class="promise-icon">✅</div>
        <div>
          <h4>Your control</h4>
          <p>You decide how your story is used. You can request changes or removal at any time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="promise-card">
        <div class="promise-icon">🎯</div>
        <div>
          <h4>Purposeful use</h4>
          <p>Stories are used only to protect others — through awareness, education, and better detection.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="promise-card">
        <div class="promise-icon">💬</div>
        <div>
          <h4>Follow-up support</h4>
          <p>If you want to talk more, we can connect you with resources and support communities.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="promise-card">
        <div class="promise-icon">🙏</div>
        <div>
          <h4>Gratitude</h4>
          <p>We recognize the courage it takes to share. Thank you for helping protect others.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Form Section -->
<section id="form" class="form-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="form-container">
      <div class="form-header">
        <h2 class="form-title">שתף את הסיפור שלך</h2>
        <p class="form-subtitle">Take your time. Share as much or as little as you're comfortable with. Every detail helps, but nothing is required except what happened.</p>
      </div>
      
      <form class="story-form" id="story-form">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label" for="scam-type">What type of scam was it?</label>
          <select class="form-select" id="scam-type" name="scam_type">
            <option value="">Select if you know...</option>
            <option value="voice_cloning">Voice cloning / AI impersonation</option>
            <option value="romance">Romance scam</option>
            <option value="bank_impersonation">Bank or government impersonation</option>
            <option value="tech_support">Tech support scam</option>
            <option value="investment">Investment or crypto scam</option>
            <option value="job">Job or employment scam</option>
            <option value="phishing">Phishing email or text</option>
            <option value="family_emergency">Family emergency scam</option>
            <option value="other">Other / Not sure</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        
        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label" for="story">What happened? <span class="form-label-optional">(required)</span></label>
          <textarea class="form-textarea" id="story" name="story" required placeholder="Tell us your story in your own words. What did the scammer say or do? What made it convincing? How did you realize it was a scam? Don't worry about structure — just share what feels important."></textarea>
          <p class="form-hint">Share as much or as little as you're comfortable with. Real details help others recognize similar tactics.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label" for="lesson">What do you wish you had known? <span class="form-label-optional">(optional)</span></label>
          <textarea class="form-textarea" id="lesson" name="lesson" style="min-height: 100px;" placeholder="Looking back, what warning sign do you wish you'd noticed? What would you tell someone in the same situation?"></textarea>
        </div>
        
        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label" for="email">Email <span class="form-label-optional">(optional — only if you'd like us to follow up)</span></label>
          <input type="email" class="form-input" id="email" name="email" placeholder="your@email.com"/>
          <p class="form-hint">We'll only use this to follow up if you want, or to let you know if your story helped someone.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="form-checkbox-group">
          <input type="checkbox" class="form-checkbox" id="anonymous" name="anonymous" checked/>
          <label class="form-checkbox-label" for="anonymous">Keep my story anonymous. Don't include any details that could identify me if this story is shared publicly.</label>
        </div>
        
        <div class="form-checkbox-group">
          <input type="checkbox" class="form-checkbox" id="consent" name="consent" required/>
          <label class="form-checkbox-label" for="consent">I understand my story may be used (anonymously unless I specify otherwise) to help educate others and improve scam detection. I can request removal at any time by emailing info@asps.io.</label>
        </div>
        
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-pink" style="width: 100%; margin-top: 16px;">
          Share my story
          <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </button>
      </form>
      
      <div class="form-success" id="form-success">
        <div class="form-success-icon">💜</div>
        <h3>Thank you for your courage.</h3>
        <p>Your story has been received. What you've shared will help protect others from experiencing the same thing. You've turned a painful experience into something powerful.<br><br>If you left your email, we may reach out. Otherwise, know that your contribution matters more than you might realize.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Footer -->
<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <svg width="120" height="32" viewBox="0 0 148 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <rect x="0" y="0" width="3" height="40" rx="1.5" fill="url(#footerLogoGrad)"/>
          <text x="12" y="27" font-family="'Syne', serif" font-weight="800" font-size="22" fill="#FFFFFF" letter-spacing="-0.5">ASPS</text>
          <circle cx="20" cy="6" r="4" fill="#BE3A4B"/>
          <circle cx="20" cy="6" r="2" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="footerLogoGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="40" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#BE3A4B"/>
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#8E1A2A"/>
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
        </svg>
        <p>Protección en tiempo real con IA contra fraudes, estafas e ingeniería social. Protegemos a las personas en el momento crucial.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Plataforma</h4>
        <a href="platform.html">Cómo funciona</a>
        <a href="individuals.html#individuals">Para particulares</a>
        <a href="individuals.html#families">Para familias</a>
        <a href="partners.html">Para socios</a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Recursos</h4>
        <a href="knowledge.html">Centro de conocimiento</a>
        <a href="knowledge.html">Inteligencia antifraude</a>
        <a href="stories.html#support">Obtener ayuda</a>
        <a href="stories.html">Historias</a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Empresa</h4>
        <a href="about.html">Nosotros</a>
        <a href="about.html#mission">Nuestra misión</a>
        <a href="about.html#ethics">Ética y confianza</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contacto</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p>© 2026 ASPS. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="privacy.html">Privacidad</a>
        <a href="privacy.html#terms">Términos</a>
        <a href="privacy.html#cookies">Cookies</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
// Form submission
document.getElementById('story-form').addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
  e.preventDefault();
  this.style.display = 'none';
  document.getElementById('form-success').style.display = 'block';
  window.scrollTo({ top: document.getElementById('form').offsetTop - 100, behavior: 'smooth' });
});
</script>
<script src="../cookie-banner.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
